### Call BookingService (through API Gateway)
### Port is dynamic — update @baseUrl after each Aspire restart
@baseUrl = http://localhost:64963
@bookingId = 28bbe4c0-7cfe-4e02-93b5-b42962d8a4ef

### Create Booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "catalogId": "9118de00-bc3c-4551-9e68-4e760b6a7c5b",
  "checkIn": "2026-06-08",
  "checkOut": "2026-06-09"
}

### Get Booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### Cancel Booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}?reason=Change%20of%20plans

